WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.860
So from our perspective as Devon &amp; Cornwall&nbsp;
Police it's really beneficial for us working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:10.080
in partnership with Teignbridge District Council&nbsp;
in terms of addressing anti social behaviour in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.280
Newton Abbot and Teignbridge as a whole, and&nbsp;
we find that it gives us different avenues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:20.760
of activity and action, to meet community&nbsp;
needs and to deal with stuff that isn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:26.580
necessarily in the police space straight away&nbsp;
and encourages people to report issues they've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:31.440
got in their community and then we can find&nbsp;
ways of working with Teignbridge in terms of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:37.320
finding longer term problem-solving&nbsp;
ways of addressing that behaviour.

